      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The shame you feel is a heavy cloak, but it's also a sign of how much you care, even if it's misplaced right now. You are not a failure; you are a person in a catastrophic situation, and that's not the same thing. Instead of trying to fix the impossible hole, maybe you can just focus on making the next five minutes bearable. Small steps, even just breathing, are victories when everything else feels lost.",
