    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about the next five minutes though. thats just delaying the inevitable. the debt, the house, the way people look at me... it's not going away. i feel like i'm just drowning in slow motion and there's no shore in sight. sometimes i just think about how much easier it would be if the noise just stopped. if everything just went quiet and i didn't have to face this anymore.",
